  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/242/379/64/64/637134045284508458.png\" alt=\"Auth Me 图标\"></p>\n<h1>Auth Me</h1>\n<p>在 Minecraft 中进行身份验证并重新验证您的会话</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/axieum/authme/actions/workflows/release.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/axieum/authme/release.yml?branch=main&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"构建状态\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/axieum/authme/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/axieum/authme?style=for-the-badge&include_prereleases&sort=semver\" alt=\"发布版本\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/auth-me\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/Available For_356643_latest.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"支持版本\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/auth-me/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_356643_downloads.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" alt=\"下载量\"></a></p>\n<p>Auth Me 是一款<strong>Minecraft 模组</strong>，旨在将账号认证功能引入游戏，以解决连接服务器时著名的会话验证错误问题。</p>\n<p>这是一款仅支持<strong>客户端</strong>的模组，适用于现代版本的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft</a> Java 版。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/axieum/authme/blob/main/demo.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"Auth Me 演示\"></p>\n<h4>替代方案</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TechnicianLP/ReAuth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ReAuth</a>（由 TechnicianLP 开发）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Sintinium/oauth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OAuth</a>（由 Sintinium 开发）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>赞助者</h2>\n<p>我们衷心感谢以下赞助者对 Auth Me 开发的支持。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252faxieum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/b9fe4fbe-8cc4-42cc-a545-dfd1b46d20e6.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting\"></a></p>\n<h2>贡献指南</h2>\n<p>感谢您考虑为 Auth Me 做出贡献！请参阅<a href=\"https://github.com/axieum/authme/blob/main/.github/CONTRIBUTING.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">贡献指南</a>。</p>\n<h2>安全漏洞</h2>\n<p>请查阅<a href=\"https://github.com/axieum/authme/blob/main/.github/SECURITY.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">安全政策</a>，了解如何报告安全漏洞。</p>\n<h2>许可证</h2>\n<p>Auth Me 是开源软件，采用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fopensource.org%252flicenses%252fMIT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT 许可证</a>授权。</p>",
